          <choice_text>스코트 결선</choice_text>
          <commentary>스코트 결선은 3상-2상 변환이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2중 성형 결선</choice_text>
          <commentary>2중 성형 결선은 6상을 얻는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
